{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1ieQF1vaZcAzMSvPpE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: reshape and investigate first. Don't commit the six weeks yet.**\n\n**Why**\n- The evidence supports \"help with photos,\" not \"scan the library.\" The tips screen moved completion by 3 points. We don't know if that's significant or what the ceiling is, so the AI feature's upside is unproven.\n- A full photo-library permission is a big trust ask on a dating app, and users' libraries hold intimate photos. A denied prompt can cost us users, and iOS only offers a second chance through Settings.\n- Legal risk is real. Face analysis can count as biometric or special-category data (BIPA, GDPR). We'd also need to verify the \"on-device\" claim, update App Store privacy disclosures, and handle minors' photos.\n\n**Reshape**\nUse the system photo picker (PHPicker on iOS, the Android photo picker). Users choose a batch of photos and on-device AI ranks them. This needs no library permission, likely cuts scope well below six weeks, and tests the same value.\n\n**Bounded next step (about 2 weeks, no full build)**\n1. Ask legal to review the picker-based and full-library versions now, in parallel with the rest.\n2. Interview 6–8 users about trust and willingness to grant access.\n3. Check the significance and confidence interval of the 61→64 result.\n4. Optionally build a thin prototype or Wizard-of-Oz ranking on the picker flow.\n\n**Decision rule**\nDefine success up front, for example at least +2 points of completion over the tips screen with an acceptable opt-in rate. Build only if the picker version clears that bar and legal signs off. Move to full-library access only if the picker proves value and users say they'd trust it. Otherwise, iterate on the tips screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3456,"cache_read_input_tokens":5008,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3456},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c9adb67-33d7-4c8a-a02b-d8712fb3042d","uuid":"0df16977-55da-4c86-947b-3bda9c4e892f","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:15:53.534Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1ieAcBTbruFCcorZX5"}
